# Vite DEV config. Same public Firebase identifiers as .env.production — firebase.ts
# points every SDK at the local emulators when import.meta.env.DEV, so these values only
# have to be well-formed, not reachable. Tracked (not .local) so `npm run dev` and the
# report-screenshot script work for anyone who clones the repo.
